let __v_479 = Value::from("For the calf, stand with both hands on a wall, one leg back with the heel flat on the floor and the back knee straight, and lean in until you feel it pull: hold 30 seconds, three times each side. Then bend the back knee slightly, keeping the heel down, for the lower calf. Stretch after you run rather than before, when the muscle is warm, and breathe out into the stretch instead of bouncing.");
